msgstr ""
"Je taalvoorkeur wordt opgeslagen in het bestand config.json en geldt voor"
" alle browsers die deze applicatie gebruiken."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:16
msgid ""
"Sometimes the tile visit state gets corrupted and needs to be re-indexed."
" This will clear the current tile visit cache and re-scan all activities "
"to rebuild it."
msgstr ""
"Soms raakt de tegelbezoekstatus beschadigd en moet die opnieuw worden "
"geïndexeerd. Dit wist de huidige tegelbezoekcache en scant alle "
"activiteiten opnieuw om die weer op te bouwen."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:18
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to reset the tile visit state? This can take a "
"while depending on the number of activities."
msgstr ""
"Weet je zeker dat je de tegelbezoekstatus wilt resetten? Afhankelijk van "
"het aantal activiteiten kan dit even duren."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:21
msgid "Reset tile visit state"
msgstr "Tegelbezoekstatus resetten"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:29
msgid "Explorer Tile History"
msgstr ""

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:33
msgid ""
"The cluster and square evolution plots and the “new cluster tiles” of "
"each activity come from replaying your tile history. That replay is only "
"redone when something invalidates it, and normally happens by itself when"
" a page needs it. Use this to force it right away."
msgstr ""

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:38
msgid "Recompute tile history"
msgstr ""

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:46
msgid "Filtered Explorer Tile Cache"
msgstr ""

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:50
msgid ""
"Showing explorer tiles for an activity filter means deriving the clusters"
" for that filter, which is cached so that the many tile images of one map"
" view share the work. Each distinct filter you use leaves an entry "
"behind."
msgstr ""

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:53
#, python-format
msgid "Currently holding %(count)s cached states using %(size)s KiB."
msgstr ""

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:58
msgid "Drop entries unused for six months"
msgstr ""

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:64
msgid "Clear the whole cache"
msgstr ""

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:72
msgid "Re-enrich All Activities"
msgstr "Alle activiteiten opnieuw verrijken"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:76
msgid ""
"Re-runs enrichment on all activities using their raw time series data. "
"Use this to apply updated processing logic (such as GPS spike filtering) "
"to existing activities."
msgstr ""
"Voert de verrijking van alle activiteiten opnieuw uit op basis van hun "
"ruwe tijdreeksen. Gebruik dit om gewijzigde verwerkingslogica (zoals het "
"filteren van GPS-uitschieters) op bestaande activiteiten toe te passen."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:78
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to re-enrich all activities? This can take a while "
"depending on the number of activities."
msgstr ""
"Weet je zeker dat je alle activiteiten opnieuw wilt verrijken? "
"Afhankelijk van het aantal activiteiten kan dit even duren."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:81
msgid "Re-enrich all activities"
msgstr "Alle activiteiten opnieuw verrijken"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:89
msgid "Activity Data Repair"
msgstr "Herstel van activiteitsgegevens"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:93
msgid ""
"Repairs all activities by re-running enrichment on raw time series data. "
"Use this when activity trimming, share picture rendering, or map data has"
" become inconsistent after previous processing errors."
msgstr ""
"Herstelt alle activiteiten door de verrijking op de ruwe tijdreeksen "
"opnieuw uit te voeren. Gebruik dit wanneer het inkorten van activiteiten,"
" het genereren van deelafbeeldingen of kaartgegevens inconsistent zijn "
"geworden na eerdere verwerkingsfouten."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:95
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to repair all activities? This can take a while "
"depending on the number of activities."
msgstr ""
"Weet je zeker dat je alle activiteiten wilt herstellen? Afhankelijk van "
"het aantal activiteiten kan dit even duren."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:98
msgid "Repair activities"
msgstr "Activiteiten herstellen"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:106
msgid "Refresh Strava Activity Names"
msgstr "Strava-activiteitsnamen vernieuwen"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:110
msgid ""
"Fetches activity summaries from Strava with paginated API calls and "
"updates local activity names by matching upstream IDs. This keeps Strava "
"as the source of truth for activity titles without re-importing "
"everything."
msgstr ""
"Haalt activiteitsoverzichten op bij Strava met gepagineerde API-aanroepen"
" en werkt de lokale activiteitsnamen bij op basis van de upstream-ID's. "
"Zo blijft Strava de bron van waarheid voor activiteitstitels zonder alles"
" opnieuw te importeren."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:112
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to refresh activity names from Strava? This can "
"take a while depending on the number of activities."
msgstr ""
"Weet je zeker dat je de activiteitsnamen van Strava wilt vernieuwen? "
"Afhankelijk van het aantal activiteiten kan dit even duren."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:115
msgid "Refresh activity names from Strava"
msgstr "Activiteitsnamen van Strava vernieuwen"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:123
msgid "Re-parse All Activities"
msgstr "Alle activiteiten opnieuw inlezen"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:127
msgid ""
"Reads every activity again from the source data that its source kept: the"
" original file for activities imported from a directory or a Strava "
"export, the cached download for activities from the Strava or Hammerhead "
"API. Use this to pick up parser improvements or to recover from a "
"corrupted time series cache."
msgstr ""
"Leest elke activiteit opnieuw in uit de brongegevens die de bron heeft "
"bewaard: het oorspronkelijke bestand voor activiteiten uit een map of een"
" Strava-export, de opgeslagen download voor activiteiten uit de Strava- "
"of Hammerhead-API. Gebruik dit om verbeteringen aan de parsers over te "
"nemen of om een beschadigde tijdreekscache te herstellen."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:130
msgid ""
"Names, kinds, equipment and tags that you set by hand are stored "
"separately from what the source states and are not touched. Activities "
"whose source data is no longer available are skipped."
msgstr ""
"Namen, typen, uitrusting en tags die je zelf hebt ingesteld, worden los "
"van de opgave van de bron opgeslagen en blijven ongemoeid. Activiteiten "
"waarvan de brongegevens niet meer beschikbaar zijn, worden overgeslagen."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:132
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to re-parse all activities? This can take a while "
"depending on the number of activities."
msgstr ""
"Weet je zeker dat je alle activiteiten opnieuw wilt inlezen? Afhankelijk "
"van het aantal activiteiten kan dit even duren."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:135
msgid "Re-parse all activities"
msgstr "Alle activiteiten opnieuw inlezen"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:143
msgid "Time Zone Fixer"
msgstr "Tijdzone-fixer"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:147
msgid ""
"Prior to version 1.3.0, activity times were interpreted in the local time"
" zone. Use these actions to reinterpret already-imported activity "
"timestamps."
msgstr ""
"Vóór versie 1.3.0 werden activiteitstijden in de lokale tijdzone "
"geïnterpreteerd. Gebruik deze acties om de tijdstempels van reeds "
"geïmporteerde activiteiten opnieuw te interpreteren."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:150
msgid ""
"Your activities are shown in the local time zone but the times look wrong"
" (all off by your UTC offset):"
msgstr ""
"Je activiteiten worden in de lokale tijdzone getoond, maar de tijden "
"lijken verkeerd (allemaal verschoven met je UTC-offset):"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:152
msgid ""
"Are you sure you want to reinterpret all activity times as local timezone"
" and convert to UTC?"
msgstr ""
"Weet je zeker dat je alle activiteitstijden als lokale tijdzone wilt "
"interpreteren en naar UTC wilt omrekenen?"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:155
msgid "Interpret times as local time zone"
msgstr "Interpreteer tijden als lokale tijdzone"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:159
msgid ""
"Your activities seem to be UTC but times appear off — re-apply timezone "
"from coordinates:"
msgstr ""
"Je activiteiten lijken in UTC te staan maar de tijden lijken verschoven —"
" bepaal de tijdzone opnieuw uit de coördinaten:"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:161
msgid "Are you sure you want to re-apply UTC timezone to all activities?"
msgstr ""
"Weet je zeker dat je de UTC-tijdzone opnieuw op alle activiteiten wilt "
"toepassen?"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:164
msgid "Interpret times as UTC"
msgstr "Interpreteer tijden als UTC"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:172
msgid "Wipe Local Activity State"
msgstr "Lokale activiteitsgegevens wissen"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:176
msgid ""
"This deletes all imported activities and related local state. It "
"truncates most database tables, clears the Cache, Time Series, and Photos"
" directories, and resets Strava sync progress. Equipment, kinds, and "
"Strava API credentials are preserved."
msgstr ""
"Dit verwijdert alle geïmporteerde activiteiten en de bijbehorende lokale "
"gegevens. De meeste databasetabellen worden geleegd, evenals de mappen "
"Cache, Time Series en Photos, en de voortgang van de Strava-"
"synchronisatie wordt gereset. Uitrusting, typen en Strava-API-gegevens "
"blijven behouden."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:178
msgid "Are you sure you want to wipe local activity state? This cannot be undone."
msgstr ""
"Weet je zeker dat je de lokale activiteitsgegevens wilt wissen? Dit kan "
"niet ongedaan worden gemaakt."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/maintenance.html.j2:181
msgid "Wipe local activity state"
msgstr "Lokale activiteitsgegevens wissen"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/map-display.html.j2:14
msgid "Show progress markers on the activity map"
msgstr "Voortgangsmarkeringen op de activiteitenkaart tonen"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/possible-duplicates.html.j2:10
msgid ""
"These pairs of activities from different sources have a similar start "
"time, distance, and duration, so they are likely the same ride imported "
"twice. Pick which one to keep; its tags, equipment, kind, and photos are "
"carried over from the other one if it does not already have them, and the"
" other activity is removed (its source file is untouched but excluded "
"from future re-import). See Settings → Duplicate Matching to tune "
"detection or turn on automatic resolution."
