#, python-format
msgid "When an explorer tile is at least %(width)d px wide"
msgstr "Wanneer een explorer-tegel minstens %(width)d px breed is"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-rendering.html.j2:105
msgid ""
"Explorer tiles double in on-screen size with every zoom step, so a lower "
"value shows the grid when zoomed further out."
msgstr ""
"Explorer-tegels verdubbelen in schermgrootte bij elke zoomstap, dus een "
"lagere waarde toont het raster ook verder uitgezoomd."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:8
msgid "Tile Source"
msgstr "Tegelbron"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:10
msgid ""
"You can change the tile source to be whatever you like. Be aware that "
"different sources have different licensing constraints. It is on you to "
"make sure that you are allowed to use the tiles from the source that you "
"enter. See"
msgstr ""
"Je kunt de tegelbron wijzigen naar wat je wilt. Wees je ervan bewust dat "
"verschillende bronnen verschillende licentiebeperkingen hebben. Het is "
"aan jou om ervoor te zorgen dat je de tegels mag gebruiken van de bron "
"die je invoert. Zie"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:11
msgid "this list of raster tile providers"
msgstr "deze lijst van rastertegelleveranciers"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:11
msgid "for inspiration."
msgstr "voor inspiratie."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:16
msgid "Map tile URL"
msgstr "Kaarttegel-URL"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:18
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"The URL must contain the placeholders {zoom}, {x} and {y}. The widespread"
" {z} is accepted as well and converted into {zoom}. Before saving, a "
"sample tile is downloaded to verify that the tile source works."
msgstr ""
"De URL moet de plaatshouders {zoom}, {x} en {y} bevatten. Het "
"gebruikelijke {z} wordt ook geaccepteerd en omgezet naar {zoom}. Voor het"
" opslaan wordt een voorbeeldtegel gedownload om te controleren of de "
"tegelbron werkt."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:20
msgid "See the documentation on the map tile source."
msgstr "Zie de documentatie over de kaarttegelbron."

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:23
msgid "Map tile attribution"
msgstr "Kaarttegel naamsvermelding"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:28
msgid "Hillshade overlay"
msgstr ""

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:30
msgid ""
"These settings control how the Mapterhorn hillshade overlay is drawn over"
" the base map. Lower the opacity to make it subtler. The blend mode "
"determines how it combines with the map below: multiply darkens and suits"
" bright base maps, whereas screen lightens and suits dark base maps."
msgstr ""

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:33
msgid "Hillshade opacity"
msgstr ""

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:38
msgid "Hillshade blend mode"
msgstr ""

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:49
msgid "Test image"
msgstr "Testafbeelding"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:52
msgid "This is a tile using your current tile source:"
msgstr "Dit is een tegel met je huidige tegelbron:"

#: src/geo_activity_playground/webui/templates/settings/tile-source.html.j2:56
